{"id":"llvm-stress-13.1","n":"llvm-stress-13","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"llvm-13","ver":"1:13.0.1-2ubuntu2.2","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/l/llvm-toolchain-13/llvm-13_13.0.1-2ubuntu2.2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/llvm-stress-13.1.gz","sha256":"eaa88c10d1db64553c4168816ac58c952988e7b07b21daff225c35c0a935cb95","date":"2023-07-14","origin":"13"}},"nopt":{"u":3},"desc":"generate random .ll files","u":[["NAME","<p>llvm-stress - generate random .ll files</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>llvm-stress</b> [-size=filesize] [-seed=initialseed] [-o=outfile]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>The <b>llvm-stress</b> tool is used to generate random <b>.ll</b> files that can be used to test different components of LLVM.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-o filename</b></dt><dd>Specify the output filename.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-size size</b></dt><dd>Specify the size of the generated <b>.ll</b> file.</dd></dl> </div> <br> <div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-seed seed</b></dt><dd>Specify the seed to be used for the randomly generated instructions.</dd></dl> </div> <br>"],["EXIT STATUS","<p><b>llvm-stress</b> returns 0.</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Maintained by the LLVM Team (https://llvm.org/).</p>"],["COPYRIGHT","<p>2003-2023, LLVM Project</p>"]]}